    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Docstring, Lean integers, and the math-KG spec still name the same laws. Pass 2 adds an explicit code path for the dispersion curve comparison and the flank ROI, both pointed at from the measurement list. Still no equation-number map onto Prum & Williamson 2002, whose follicle geometry is not what is integrated." ;
